{"repositoryId":1409514456,"availability":"available","full":"RayVelez27/instalanding.ai","name":"instalanding.ai","description":"Free, open-source library of premium, single-file HTML landing pages, motion components, and interactive experiences. No frameworks. No dependencies. Built for humans and AI coding agents.","category":"Developer tools","language":"HTML","stars":83,"forks":8,"created":"2026-10-08T00:17:09Z","updated":"2026-10-20T01:15:12Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://instalanding.ai","topics":[],"demo":"https://instalanding.ai/demos/kestrel-finance.html","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:02.337Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:02.337Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-20T05:30:02.337Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T21:03:10.535Z","stars":79,"forks":8},{"at":"2026-10-20T05:30:02.337Z","stars":83,"forks":8}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Premium pages built for humans and agents. One file. No dependencies. Copy it, remix it, ship it.","Every page in this repo is a complete landing page in a single HTML file — CSS, JavaScript, SVG art and images all inline — that opens straight from disk. Nothing to install and no build step: fonts come from Google Fonts, and a few pages load GSAP or Three.js from a CDN. Next to each one is the one-shot prompt it was built from: a brief detailed enough that an AI builder or coding agent produces the page in one pass.","Alongside the pages are design systems: the visual language behind a page, pulled out of it so you (or your agent) can build more in that style — design tokens as CSS custom properties, the page's own components scoped so they can't clash with yours, and the conventions that hold them together. See Design systems."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RayVelez27/instalanding.ai/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3f732c41122927a5d5e215aebe6c5340d1b7f3232c5e10ba62c9782a3ab1bd53","extractedAt":"2026-10-20T05